# State can contain sensitive infrastructure data and resource identifiers.
# Never commit it.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
terraform.tfvars
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored. Commit it — it pins
# the exact provider versions so an apply from another machine resolves to the
# same AWS provider build you tested with.
